 text-align: justify;}p.docx_28 span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}span.docx_29 {  font-style: italic;  color: #2F5597;}p.docx_30 {  border-top: 0.50pt solid #2F5496;  border-bottom: 0.50pt solid #2F5496;  margin-top: 18.00pt;  margin-bottom: 18.00pt;  margin-left: 43.20pt;  margin-right: 43.20pt;  text-align: center;}p.docx_30 span {  font-style: italic;  color: #2F5597;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}p.docx_30 span {  font-style: italic;  color: #2F5597;}span.docx_31 {  font-style: italic;  color: #2F5597;}span.docx_31 p {  border-top: 0.50pt solid #2F5496;  border-bottom: 0.50pt solid #2F5496;  margin-top: 18.00pt;  margin-bottom: 18.00pt;  margin-left: 43.20pt;  margin-right: 43.20pt;  text-align: center;}span.docx_31 {  font-style: italic;  color: #2F5597;  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}span.docx_32 {  font-weight: bold;  text-transform: lowercase;  color: #2F5597;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 28pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">（</span><span lang="en-US" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">通讯员 彭茹</span><span lang="null" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">）</span><span style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">5月21日下午，</span><span lang="en-US" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学校</span><span style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学生资助管理中心联合中国银行召开2025届毕业生诚信教育暨校园地国家助学贷款毕业手续办理宣讲</span><span lang="en-US" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">会。</span><span style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">作为学校“诚信宣传教育月”</span><span lang="en-US" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">重要活动之一</span><span lang="null" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span lang="en-US" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">宣讲会旨在通过“</span><span style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">办一场会、育一群人、树一面旗”的多重效益，</span><span lang="en-US" style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">强化学生感恩教育和诚信意识，服务毕业生贷款手续办理，</span><span style="text-indent: 24pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">确保毕业生顺利离校。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">会上，中国银行工作人员以“防范电信诈骗，共建和谐校园”为主题</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">作</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">金融知识专题报告</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">从防范电信诈骗、征信与校园贷、银行卡的重要性等方面着手，通过引用真实案例讲解如何识别诈骗手段，遇到诈骗时</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">该</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">如何</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">有效处理等</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">。同时，详细介绍了征信的重要性及常见的不良校园贷类别，帮助学生了解征信知识，并呼吁同学们</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">常怀资助感恩之心，经常学习金融知识、时刻</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">加强</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">安全</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">防范</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">树立正确</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">消费观。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">随后，工作人员为大家</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">详细</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">讲解校园地</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">、</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">生源地</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">国家助学贷款还款注意事项，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">并逐一答疑解惑</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">。</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">同时</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">提醒同学们</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">珍爱个人信用，如期履行贷款</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">合同</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; color: black; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">避免因逾期影响个人征信。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 方正仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 212.45pt; height: 141.75pt;"><img src="/__local/6/CE/B4/C6EF93988E6061568A7367B68EA_174205B1_934D.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/6CEB4C6EF93988E6061568A7367B68EA/174205B1/934D" vheight=" 141.75pt" vwidth=" 212.45pt" orisrc="/__local/8/BC/FA/610A78D42652EA5F57CD2F5F64D_B0DD8D77_8C55.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 212.45pt; height: 141.75pt;"></span></span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 212.8pt; height: 141.75pt;"><img src="/__local/8/36/BC/A7675D4CA29CA94DA699E2A7E77_1310A538_8AFA.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/836BCA7675D4CA29CA94DA699E2A7E77/1310A538/8AFA" vheight=" 141.75pt" vwidth=" 212.8pt" orisrc="/__local/4/90/50/AE48423CF319BD8372C8D1A2F95_9A50AB29_8324.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 212.8pt; height: 141.75pt;"><span style="text-indent: 0pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"><span style="position: relative; width: 212.35pt; height: 141.75pt;"><img src="/__local/6/9A/DD/47A78F1E3487A31E66370805F43_A4967000_7531.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/69ADD47A78F1E3487A31E66370805F43/A4967000/7531" vheight=" 141.75pt" vwidth=" 212.35pt" orisrc="/__local/A/6B/0F/EB53636E47180E8BF1650FBA1F2_47F9DFF4_EA42.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 212.35pt; height: 141.75pt;"></span></span><span lang="null" style="text-indent: 0pt; font-family: 宋体; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"><span style="position: relative; width: 212.35pt; height: 141.75pt;"><img src="/__local/7/7D/01/9FDB4274F9B296EF824D7A60B3F_F661807E_A7F0.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/77D019FDB4274F9B296EF824D7A60B3F/F661807E/A7F0" vheight=" 141.75pt" vwidth=" 212.35pt" orisrc="/__local/F/D3/EE/B3ABE99E7A18E4F1E932B4CECF3_A9F94525_9DE3.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 212.35pt; height: 141.75pt;"></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">毕业生还贷不仅涉及到学校助学贷款工作运转，更是毕业生诚信品格和道德风尚的体现，每位受助学生都应当做到守信践诺，维护好个人良好信用。同时，后续毕业确认手续办理过程中，学校也将通过QQ群、工作电话等方式，持续做好跟踪支持服务，解答同学们的疑惑，确保所有同学顺利办理相关手续。</span></p><p style="line-height: 2; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">中国银行西安融鑫路支行、</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学校</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">学生资助管理中心</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">工作人员及</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">国家助学贷款毕业生</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">共计近百人</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">参加</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">宣讲。</span></p></article></section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
